    "title": "DOJ grants Trump total immunity from investigations - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dorcas Onasa ,\n2 hours ago The Department of Justice made an extraordinary legal move, issuing a one page order that permanently bars the federal government from prosecuting Donald Trump over his taxes. The order extends the same protection to his family members and his trusts a decision that has since ignited fierce debate among legal scholars, lawmakers and government watchdogs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
